adapter=apple_fm reps=5

escape:
  control: {data: ...} (Ruby path, no LLM)     pass 5/5  squished 0/5  avg 0.0s
  bare String                                  pass 5/5  squished 5/5  avg 0.6s
  JSON String                                  pass 5/5  squished 5/5  avg 0.5s
  string-keyed Hash                            pass 5/5  squished 5/5  avg 0.5s
  nested Hash                                  pass 5/5  squished 5/5  avg 0.5s
  Array of one String                          pass 5/5  squished 5/5  avg 0.5s
  Hash, renamed key (body:)                    pass 5/5  squished 5/5  avg 0.5s
  Hash with noise + wrong key                  pass 3/5  squished 5/5  avg 0.4s
  nil (nothing to recover)                     pass 5/5  squished 5/5  avg 0.4s
  TOTAL                                        pass 43/45
